PROJECT: AGRICARE — AI-POWERED CROP HEALTH AND FARMER ASSISTANCE PLATFORM

Act as an expert full-stack web developer, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, agricultural technology specialist, and product designer. Build a beautiful, modern, responsive, and functional website named AgriCare that helps farmers identify crop diseases, understand their causes, receive affordable treatment recommendations, purchase agricultural products, and manage their farming activities.

This is a second-year engineering college community engagement project designed to support farmers, especially small and financially constrained farmers in India.

The website must be practical for real farmers, easy to understand, mobile-friendly, accessible to users with limited technical knowledge, and available in three languages: English, Marathi, and Hindi.

Do not create only a static landing page or a simple UI mockup. Build a complete, interactive website with working navigation, functional forms, realistic data, AI integration where possible, and clear feedback for user actions.

If any external API, database, payment gateway, or live data source requires credentials, create a properly structured integration and a clearly labelled demonstration mode instead of pretending that live functionality is working.

